      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> First, we have the Red Hat OpenShift AI Operator :\n\n\n\n        ° This is installed like all the other Operators \n          through the Operator Hub, \n        and \n        ° it is available there for download\n\n ",
