      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> RHOAI Architecture is organized in 2 layers :\n\n        ° Management Layer :\n\n            - The Management layer consists of the Red Hat OpenShift AI Operator, which acts as a meta-operator\n\n            - The operator deploys, configures, and maintains all service layer components and sub-operators\n\n        ° Service Layer : \n\n            - The service layer is where the data scientists, ML engineers, and developers work directly",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> RHOAI Architecture is organized in 2 layers :\n\n        ° Management Layer :\n\n            - The Management layer consists of the Red Hat OpenShift AI Operator, which acts as a meta-operator\n\n            - The operator deploys, configures, and maintains all service layer components and sub-operators\n\n        ° Service Layer : \n\n            - The service layer is where the data scientists, ML engineers, and developers work directly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793778084341,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
